  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: "\"G\xF6k Dal\u0131, Yer Dal\u0131 ve Ulu \xD6z... Ata A\u011Fac\u0131'n\u0131n \xFC\xE7 dal\u0131, bir kahraman\u0131n yolunu anlat\u0131r.\""
    duration: 0
    setFlag: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: "\"\xDClgen'in miras\u0131 h\u0131z ve y\u0131ld\u0131r\u0131md\u0131r; yeralt\u0131n\u0131n \xF6z\xFC dayan\u0131kl\u0131l\u0131k; Kayra'n\u0131n k\u0131v\u0131lc\u0131m\u0131 ise hepsini b\xFCy\xFCt\xFCr.\""
